# Machine-local, never committed: any `.local` file, with the suffix in either
# position. Covers AGENTS.local.md at any depth and .claude/settings.local.json.
# A committed *example* of a local file documents it for every clone, so it is
# re-included; any other collision is a per-repo `!` line, not a change here.
*.local
*.local.*
!*.local.example*
# Project virtualenvs, whatever the environment named them: .venv on a host,
# .venv-sandbox in a sandbox container. Repos never choose the name.
.venv*/
# Native plan-mode drafts (plansDirectory) — durable plans get promoted to work/NNNN-slug/
work/plans/
# Tool snapshot caches — regenerable, and may carry customer-identifying names
.cache/
